# Bench data artifacts — regenerable from scripts in the same dir, too
# large or session-specific to source-control. Scaffolding (README.md,
# input .toml fixtures, run scripts) stays tracked; the campaign-level
# findings are consolidated into HISTORY.md here. Only raw produced
# data is ignored.
atlas_retrieval/chunks-*.jsonl
atlas_retrieval/bench-results-*.json
atlas_retrieval/bench-report-*.md
atlas_retrieval/brief-quality-*
atlas_retrieval/regression-*.jsonl
atlas_retrieval/regression-*.md
atlas_retrieval/embedding-comparison.md
atlas_retrieval/golden-gt-*.jsonl
atlas_throughput/run-*.json
atlas_throughput/run-*.log
sep_atlas/logs/
sep_eval/
voice/baseline/*.json
voice/baseline/*.txt
voice/baseline/*.md
voice/baseline/diff-*.txt
